    "Postman could not access this datasource's Vault secrets in time. Make sure Vault is unlocked, then retry.": "Postman 未能及时访问该数据源的 Vault 密钥。请确认 Vault 已解锁后重试。",
    "Preview is currently not available for JDBC sources. Run a query against your database by creating a view.": "JDBC 数据源目前不支持预览。请创建视图并对数据库执行查询。",
    "Choose the JDBC driver JAR, not a source archive or bundle. It must expose a java.sql.Driver implementation.": "请选择 JDBC 驱动 JAR，而不是源码包或捆绑包。它必须提供 java.sql.Driver 的实现。",
    "What would you like to call this kind of a database connection? You can choose a name that helps you remember.": "你想把这类数据库连接叫什么？可以取一个方便自己记住的名字。",
    "The JDBC type and URL template are stored in the dataset YAML. The Java runtime path stays local to this computer.": "JDBC 类型和 URL 模板会存放在数据集的 YAML 中，Java 运行时路径只保存在本机。",
    "This folder will be disconnected for everyone in that workspace. Finish creating your workspace to connect it here.": "该工作区中的所有人都会断开与此文件夹的连接。完成工作区创建后即可在这里连接它。",
    "The .jar file containing the JDBC driver and any companion .jar files it needs. Files are loaded in the order shown.": "包含 JDBC 驱动的 .jar 文件，以及它所需的配套 .jar 文件。文件按显示顺序加载。",
    "Stores this as a team-level secret, shared with everyone on your team. Leave it unchecked to keep the secret to yourself.": "把它保存为团队级密钥，与团队所有人共享。不勾选则仅自己可见。",
    "Datasets let you store, connect, and reuse structured data in Postman, from files to live databases. Upgrade your plan to get started.": "数据集让你在 Postman 中存放、连接并复用结构化数据，从文件到线上数据库都支持。升级套餐即可开始使用。",
    "This query is sent directly as it is to the database through its JDBC driver. Autocomplete and SQL validation may not be available yet.": "该查询会通过 JDBC 驱动原样发送到数据库。自动补全和 SQL 校验可能暂不可用。",
    "Postman could not resolve one or more Vault secrets used by this datasource. Unlock Vault and check that the linked secrets still exist.": "Postman 无法解析该数据源使用的一个或多个 Vault 密钥。请解锁 Vault，并确认关联的密钥仍然存在。",
    "Pick a JDBC driver .jar and any dependency .jar files it needs. Postman reads the available driver classes and checks your Java runtime.": "选择 JDBC 驱动 .jar 及其依赖的 .jar 文件。Postman 会读取可用的驱动类并检查你的 Java 运行时。",
    "This JDBC type is currently available only in this dataset. Java is detected on this computer, and its path is not stored in the dataset.": "该 JDBC 类型目前仅在本数据集中可用。Java 在本机检测得到，其路径不会存进数据集。",
    "Local files aren't available on the web. Open the Postman desktop app to query a local file, or use a remote file or database source here.": "网页版不支持本地文件。请打开 Postman 桌面应用来查询本地文件，或在这里改用远程文件或数据库数据源。",
    "Local files aren’t available on the web. Open the Postman desktop app to query a local file, or use a remote file or database source here.": "网页版不支持本地文件。请打开 Postman 桌面应用来查询本地文件，或在这里改用远程文件或数据库数据源。",
    "Datasets and data files let you drive your collection runs with test data. Both are available on paid plans. Upgrade your plan to get started.": "数据集和数据文件让你用测试数据驱动集合运行，两者都需要付费套餐。升级套餐即可开始使用。",
    "Choose a Java executable (…/bin/java) or a JDK/JRE home directory containing bin/java. This path stays on this computer and is not saved in YAML.": "选择一个 Java 可执行文件（…/bin/java），或包含 bin/java 的 JDK/JRE 主目录。该路径只保存在本机，不会写入 YAML。",
    "This folder isn't linked on the server for that workspace, so nothing will be disconnected. You can continue with this folder for your new workspace.": "该文件夹在服务端并未关联到那个工作区，因此不会断开任何连接。你可以继续用它作为新工作区的文件夹。",
    "This folder isn’t linked on the server for that workspace, so nothing will be disconnected. You can continue with this folder for your new workspace.": "该文件夹在服务端并未关联到那个工作区，因此不会断开任何连接。你可以继续用它作为新工作区的文件夹。",
    "A dataset organizes reusable data from files and databases so you can query it with SQL and use it across collection runs, scripts, mock servers, and monitors.": "数据集把来自文件和数据库的可复用数据组织起来，让你能用 SQL 查询，并在集合运行、脚本、Mock 服务器和监视器中使用。",
    "Local file sources are only available in local workspaces on the desktop app. Use a database or remote file source to run here, or switch to a local workspace.": "本地文件数据源仅在桌面应用的本地工作区中可用。请在这里改用数据库或远程文件数据源，或切换到本地工作区。",
    "The driver configuration is valid. Full JDBC connection testing is not available in this prototype; add the source and run a native query to verify connectivity.": "驱动配置有效。该原型暂不支持完整的 JDBC 连接测试；请添加数据源并运行一次原生查询来验证连通性。",
    "Could not save this value to Shared Vault. Check that Shared Vault is available for this workspace and that you have edit access, then retry. You can save it to Local Vault instead.": "无法把该值保存到共享 Vault。请确认该工作区可以使用共享 Vault、且你有编辑权限，然后重试。你也可以改存到本地 Vault。",
    "The actual implementation class in the .jar file that contains the code to talk to your database. Some .jar files can contain multiple of these, so please choose the one that is appropriate and supported.": ".jar 文件中真正与你的数据库通信的实现类。有些 .jar 包含多个这样的类，请选择合适且受支持的那一个。",
    "Anything still using this secret will start failing immediately — saved requests, monitors, mock servers and CI or scheduled runs will get authentication errors until they are pointed at a new credential.": "仍在使用该密钥的一切都会立即开始失败——已保存的请求、监视器、Mock 服务器以及 CI 或定时运行都会收到认证错误，直到它们改用新凭据。",
    "Anything still using these secrets will start failing immediately — saved requests, monitors, mock servers and CI or scheduled runs will get authentication errors until they are pointed at new credentials.": "仍在使用这些密钥的一切都会立即开始失败——已保存的请求、监视器、Mock 服务器以及 CI 或定时运行都会收到认证错误，直到它们改用新凭据。",
    "Every database addresses things differently: schemas, service names, instances. Fill in the URL format your database uses. Anything in double braces becomes a field you fill in when configuring your database connection.": "每种数据库的寻址方式都不同：Schema、服务名、实例。请填入你的数据库所用的 URL 格式。双花括号中的内容会变成配置数据库连接时需要你填写的字段。",
