    "The folder name contains characters that are not supported. Fix it to push to cloud.": "文件夹名称包含不支持的字符，修正后才能推送到云端。",
    "Detect breaking API changes on every PR and flag risks before they reach production.": "在每个 PR 上检测破坏性 API 变更，在风险进入生产环境前就标记出来。",
    "Mock servers let you simulate your API endpoints without having to set up a backend.": "Mock 服务器让你无需搭建后端就能模拟 API 端点。",
