    "This workspace has no collections, environments, specifications, flows, or SDKs yet.": "该工作区还没有集合、环境、规范、Flow 或 SDK。",
    "Use this API key to authorize your identity provider to access your team on Postman.": "用该 API Key 授权你的身份提供方访问你在 Postman 上的团队。",
