    "This is the classic Markdown editor that supports Git flavoured Markdown formatting.": "这是支持 Git 风味 Markdown 格式的经典 Markdown 编辑器。",
    "To resubmit your API to the Private API Network, you first need to publish your API.": "要把你的 API 重新提交到专用 API 网络，需要先发布该 API。",
    "A number of VUs to simulate before starting to ramp up to the maximum number of VUs.": "在开始爬坡到最大 VU 数之前要模拟的 VU 数量。",
    "SCIM is not enabled for your team. Enable SCIM provisioning to create SCIM API keys.": "你的团队未启用 SCIM。请先启用 SCIM 预配才能创建 SCIM API Key。",
    "Both you and the service account must be a team admin or super admin to create SCIM API keys": "你和该服务账号都必须是团队管理员或超级管理员才能创建 SCIM API Key",
    "No API keys yet. Generate one to allow this service account to authenticate with Postman APIs.": "还没有 API Key。生成一个即可让该服务账号通过 Postman API 认证。",
    "This mock is Isolated, so your first request gets its own session (shown as \"Yours\").": "该 Mock 是隔离式的，因此你的第一个请求会获得独立会话（显示为「你的」）。",
    "Each session is a separate copy of pm.state. Anyone with mock access can view any session.": "每个会话都是 pm.state 的独立副本。任何能访问该 Mock 的人都可以查看任意会话。",
    "Anyone can call it and callers aren't identified. Change this in the mock's configuration.": "任何人都可以调用它，且不会识别调用方。可在该 Mock 的配置中更改。",
    "Anyone can call it and callers aren’t identified. Change this in the mock’s configuration.": "任何人都可以调用它，且不会识别调用方。可在该 Mock 的配置中更改。",
    "where each VU receives data from a random row every time when running the collection.": "每次运行集合时，每个 VU 都会从随机的一行获取数据。",
    "Switching workspaces allows you to work with the entities configured for this folder.": "切换工作区后，你就能使用为该文件夹配置的实体。",
    "Make it easy for your team members to discover and use the right version of your API.": "让你的团队成员更容易发现并使用正确版本的 API。",
    "This item type isn't supported in your version of Postman. Update the app to view it.": "你使用的 Postman 版本不支持该项目类型，请更新应用后查看。",
    "This item type isn’t supported in your version of Postman. Update the app to view it.": "你使用的 Postman 版本不支持该项目类型，请更新应用后查看。",
    "Make sure you copy this API key now. This is the only time you'll see it unencrypted.": "请立即复制该 API Key，这是你唯一一次能看到未加密形式的机会。",
    "Make sure you copy this API key now. This is the only time you’ll see it unencrypted.": "请立即复制该 API Key，这是你唯一一次能看到未加密形式的机会。",
    "Payloads are only kept for the most recent calls, so this one is no longer available.": "负载只为最近的调用保留，因此这一条已不可用。",
    "With end-to-end encryption, Vault makes it easy to store and manage your API secrets.": "凭借端到端加密，Vault 让你轻松存放和管理 API 密钥。",
    "Your lightweight app activity is stored in History. Switch to Cloud View to access it.": "你的轻量版应用活动保存在历史记录中，切换到云端视图即可访问。",
    "This Team is configured so that all Organization users are collaborators of this Team.": "该团队已配置为：组织的所有用户都是该团队的协作者。",
    "You have already requested to join this team. You'll automatically join once approved.": "你已申请加入该团队，获批后会自动加入。",
    "Share a few details about yourself and let Postman AI help you navigate the workspace.": "分享一些你的信息，让 Postman AI 帮你熟悉这个工作区。",
    "Collaborate in real-time and establish a single source of truth for all API workflows.": "实时协作，为所有 API 工作流建立唯一可信来源。",
    "Try checking your spelling, adjusting your filters, or trying a different search term.": "试着检查拼写、调整筛选条件，或换个搜索词。",
    "\"On event\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run when a webhook event is received.": "「事件触发」脚本用 JavaScript 编写，在收到 Webhook 事件时运行。",
    "\"On message\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run each time a message is received.": "「收到消息」脚本用 JavaScript 编写，每次收到消息时运行。",
    "\"After response\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run after the webhook response is selected.": "「响应后」脚本用 JavaScript 编写，在选定 Webhook 响应之后运行。",
    "You don't have access to this workspace yet. Choose an option below to request access.": "你还没有该工作区的访问权限。请在下面选择一种方式申请。",
    "You don’t have access to this workspace yet. Choose an option below to request access.": "你还没有该工作区的访问权限。请在下面选择一种方式申请。",
