    "Make this collection discoverable by publishing it to your team's Internal API network.": "把该集合发布到你团队的内部 API 网络，让它可被发现。",
    "No workspaces require changes in this step. You can continue to complete the migration.": "该步骤中没有工作区需要改动，你可以继续完成迁移。",
