    "We couldn't check your access to this team. Please try again or contact your team admin.": "无法确认你对该团队的访问权限，请重试或联系你的团队管理员。",
    "We couldn’t check your access to this team. Please try again or contact your team admin.": "无法确认你对该团队的访问权限，请重试或联系你的团队管理员。",
