    "Can’t send request because host tab is closed. Request session host to re-open request tab": "宿主标签页已关闭，无法发送请求。请让会话宿主重新打开该请求标签页",
    "Run agents on a schedule or when events happen, and deliver results where your team works.": "按计划或在事件触发时运行 Agent，并把结果送到你团队工作的地方。",
    "workspace on the Private API Network. The workspace will not be deleted from your account.": "专用 API 网络中的工作区。该工作区不会从你的账号中删除。",
    "Authorization server does not support dynamic registration; configure a client ID manually": "授权服务器不支持动态注册，请手动配置 Client ID",
    "Partners with Viewer role cannot export collections. You can fork this collection instead.": "拥有查看者角色的合作伙伴无法导出集合，但可以复刻该集合。",
