    "Find and replace is not available in local mode. Switch to cloud mode to use this feature.": "本地模式下无法使用查找和替换，请切换到云端模式。",
    "Collaborate with your team members on Postman. It’s faster and fun to build APIs together.": "在 Postman 上与团队成员协作。一起构建 API 更快也更有意思。",
