    "Must start with a letter or underscore, and contain only letters, digits, and underscores.": "必须以字母或下划线开头，且只能包含字母、数字和下划线。",
    "Use scripts to write assertions and verify that the webhook request is handled as expected.": "用脚本编写断言，验证 Webhook 请求是否按预期被处理。",
