    "We couldn’t save your name and role. You can update your profile later in account settings.": "无法保存你的姓名和角色，你可以稍后在账号设置中更新资料。",
    "You'll review and confirm the workspaces that will be added to the new Private API Network.": "你将审核并确认要添加到新版专用 API 网络的工作区。",
    "You’ll review and confirm the workspaces that will be added to the new Private API Network.": "你将审核并确认要添加到新版专用 API 网络的工作区。",
    "Effortlessly onboard and manage Postman organization members using your identity provider. ": "使用你的身份提供方轻松引入和管理 Postman 组织成员。 ",
    "Effortlessly onboard and manage Postman organization members using your identity provider.": "使用你的身份提供方轻松引入和管理 Postman 组织成员。",
    "1. Verify your account. There should be a verification email waiting for you in your inbox.": "1. 验证你的账号。你的邮箱中应该有一封验证邮件在等你。",
    "Workspace should be accessible by the whole organization to add to the Private API Network.": "要添加到专用 API 网络，该工作区必须对整个组织可访问。",
