    "This setting is managed by your organization, and can’t be changed for your team.": "此设置由组织管理，团队无法更改。",
    "Pending team members must answer this question when requesting to join your team.": "待处理的团队成员申请加入团队时必须回答此问题。",
    "Explain why workspace creation is disabled and where users can request a workspace...": "说明为何停用工作区创建，以及用户可以在哪里申请工作区……",
    "Can edit all shared workspaces and manage members, roles, billing, and team settings.": "可以编辑所有共享工作区，并管理成员、角色、账单和团队设置。",
    "No available slots in the sandbox team. Please free up a slot before adding new members.": "沙箱团队没有可用名额。请先释放一个名额，再添加新成员。",
    "Can view shared workspaces but can’t make changes or manage team settings. Personal workspaces are unaffected.": "可以查看共享工作区，但不能更改内容或管理团队设置。个人工作区不受影响。",
    "Can view shared workspaces but can't make changes or manage team settings. Personal workspaces are unaffected.": "可以查看共享工作区，但不能更改内容或管理团队设置。个人工作区不受影响。",
    "Manage your team's vault settings, control access, and keep sensitive information secure across your workspaces.": "管理团队的保管库设置、控制访问权限，并确保工作区中的敏感信息安全。",
    "Manage your team’s vault settings, control access, and keep sensitive information secure across your workspaces.": "管理团队的保管库设置、控制访问权限，并确保工作区中的敏感信息安全。",
    "Postman will stop discovering and importing services from this gateway instance. You can connect it again at any time.": "Postman 将停止从此网关实例发现和导入服务。你可以随时重新连接。",
    "Disconnecting will permanently delete the team's stored security posture and related findings. This cannot be undone. Reconnecting will start a fresh security scan.": "断开连接将永久删除团队存储的安全态势及相关发现。此操作无法撤销。重新连接将开始全新的安全扫描。",
    "Disconnecting will permanently delete the team’s stored security posture and related findings. This cannot be undone. Reconnecting will start a fresh security scan.": "断开连接将永久删除团队存储的安全态势及相关发现。此操作无法撤销。重新连接将开始全新的安全扫描。",
    "Create and manage tags to organize elements across your organization. Use status tags to track lifecycle stages of collections, and standard tags to group and surface related elements.": "创建和管理标签，以整理组织中的元素。使用状态标签跟踪集合的生命周期阶段，使用标准标签对相关元素进行分组和展示。",
