    "Failed to update Shared Vault setting. Please try again later.": "更新共享保管库设置失败。请稍后重试。",
    "Something went wrong while loading your secrets. Please try again.": "加载密钥时出了点问题。请重试。",
    "Secrets that you've been granted access to on Passport will appear here.": "你在 Passport 上获准访问的密钥会显示在此处。",
    "Secrets that you’ve been granted access to on Passport will appear here.": "你在 Passport 上获准访问的密钥会显示在此处。",
    "For security reasons, Shared Vault is not supported in public workspaces.": "出于安全原因，公开工作区不支持共享保管库。",
