    "Optional specific version to read (KV v2 only). Defaults to the latest version.": "可选的指定版本（仅 KV v2）。默认为最新版本。",
    "We couldn't complete the sign-in. Close this window and try again from Postman.": "无法完成登录。关闭此窗口，然后从 Postman 重试。",
    "We couldn’t complete the sign-in. Close this window and try again from Postman.": "无法完成登录。关闭此窗口，然后从 Postman 重试。",
    "We couldn't start the sign-in. Make sure you're signed in to Postman and try again.": "无法开始登录。请确保已登录 Postman，然后重试。",
    "We couldn’t start the sign-in. Make sure you’re signed in to Postman and try again.": "无法开始登录。请确保已登录 Postman，然后重试。",
    "This callback is missing required parameters. Close this window and try connecting again from Postman.": "此回调缺少必需参数。关闭此窗口，然后从 Postman 重试连接。",
    "Your identity provider's issuer URL. Postman discovers its endpoints via /.well-known/openid-configuration.": "你的身份提供商颁发者 URL。Postman 通过 `/.well-known/openid-configuration` 发现其端点。",
    "Your identity provider’s issuer URL. Postman discovers its endpoints via /.well-known/openid-configuration.": "你的身份提供商颁发者 URL。Postman 通过 `/.well-known/openid-configuration` 发现其端点。",
    "This sign-in link is missing its connection reference. Close this window and try connecting again from Postman.": "此登录链接缺少连接引用。关闭此窗口，然后从 Postman 重试连接。",
    "JSON Pointer to a single field within the secret (e.g. /password). Required when the secret has more than one field.": "指向密钥中单个字段的 JSON Pointer（例如 /password）。当密钥包含多个字段时为必填项。",
    "Save settings": "保存设置",
    "Vault settings": "保管库设置",
