    "Close vault settings": "关闭保管库设置",
    "Vault settings saved": "保管库设置已保存",
    "Yes, turn off masking": "是，关闭遮蔽",
    "Team-wide vault controls": "团队范围的保管库控制",
    "Turn off secret masking?": "关闭密钥遮蔽？",
    "Allow vault secrets in scripts": "允许脚本使用保管库密钥",
    "Share secrets across all workspaces": "在所有工作区之间共享密钥",
    "Only team admins can update vault settings.": "只有团队管理员可以更新保管库设置。",
    "Failed to save vault settings. Please try again.": "保存保管库设置失败。请重试。",
    "Allow scripts to access vault secrets during request execution.": "允许脚本在请求执行期间访问保管库密钥。",
    "Could not load vault settings. Save is disabled until this is resolved.": "无法加载保管库设置。问题解决前无法保存。",
    "Your team admin controls console masking for Shared Vault secrets in Team Settings.": "团队管理员在“团队设置”中控制共享保管库密钥的控制台遮蔽。",
    "Script access for Shared Vault secrets is enabled by your team admin and cannot be changed here.": "共享保管库密钥的脚本访问权限由团队管理员启用，无法在此更改。",
    "Configure console masking for your team. Click Save settings, then refresh Postman before testing.": "配置团队的控制台遮蔽。点击“保存设置”，然后刷新 Postman 再进行测试。",
    "Make Shared Vault accessible to all workspaces the team has access to, not just the current workspace.": "让团队可访问的所有工作区都能使用共享保管库，而不仅是当前工作区。",
    "Automatically mask secrets in the console so they cannot be read in plain text. Recommended; keep this on.": "在控制台中自动遮蔽密钥，避免以明文读取。建议保持开启。",
    "Securely share sensitive data with your team. Shared Vault is available by default in every workspace except public workspaces. Override per workspace to enforce least privilege.": "与团队安全共享敏感数据。除公开工作区外，共享保管库默认在每个工作区可用。可按工作区覆盖设置，以实施最小权限。",
    "Disabling this setting means vault secrets will be visible in plain text in the console. Any teammate with access to the console will be able to read secret values directly. Are you sure you want to continue?": "停用此设置后，保管库密钥会在控制台中以明文显示。任何有权访问控制台的队友都能直接读取密钥值。确定要继续吗？",
    "Failed to load this integration’s connections": "加载此集成的连接失败",
    "Your team can’t export their vault data.": "你的团队无法导出保管库数据。",
    "Your team members will now have a smoother onboarding experience": "你的团队成员现在将拥有更顺畅的入门体验",
    "Allow team members to use packages from external registries like npm and JSR in their scripts.": "允许团队成员在脚本中使用 npm、JSR 等外部注册表中的软件包。",
    "Customer shall only use test or dummy data in Sandbox; production data and personal data must not be submitted": "客户只能在沙箱中使用测试或虚拟数据；不得提交生产数据和个人数据",
