    "For security reasons, we need to verify your email address before we can submit your join request.": "出于安全原因，提交加入申请前需要验证你的电子邮件地址。",
    "Almost there, just two quick things to do before we can send your request": "就快完成了，发送申请前还需完成两件小事",
    "Join a team or create one to start collaborating.": "加入或创建团队，开始协作。",
    "Teams help organize people and workspaces for focused collaboration.": "团队有助于组织人员和工作区，开展专注协作。",
    "Create workspaces and collaborate with team members": "创建工作区并与团队成员协作",
    "Only team members can add new members.": "只有团队成员可以添加新成员。",
    "Team Manager approval is required to join or collaborate with this team.": "加入或与此团队协作需要团队经理审批。",
    "When enabled, managers must approve team members before they’re added.": "启用后，经理必须先审批团队成员，成员才会被添加。",
