    "An error has occurred an we are working to fix the problem! We'll be up and running shortly.": "出现了错误，我们正在修复！服务很快就会恢复。",
    "Until you’re back online, you can work and save data locally by switching to your Scratch Pad.": "恢复联网前，可以切换到草稿箱在本地工作并保存数据。",
    "Until you're back online, you can work and save data locally by switching to your Scratch Pad.": "恢复联网前，可以切换到草稿箱在本地工作并保存数据。",
    "Deleting this integration will cease any actions it performs immediately. Are you sure you wish to continue?": "删除此集成会立即停止它执行的所有操作。确定要继续吗？",
    "Use AI to map your discovered services to a Git repository and a Postman workspace.": "用 AI 把已发现的服务映射到 Git 仓库和 Postman 工作区。",
    "Enable this when the service lives inside a subdirectory of the selected repository.": "当服务位于所选仓库的子目录中时启用此项。",
    "No pull requests match the selected filters. Try adjusting or clearing your filters.": "没有符合所选筛选条件的拉取请求。试试调整或清除筛选条件。",
    "Bulk onboarding uses your GitHub connection to resolve repositories for the selected services.": "批量接入会通过你的 GitHub 连接为所选服务解析对应的仓库。",
    "Filters and prompt help AI match each discovered service with the right repository and workspace.": "筛选条件和提示词可以帮助 AI 为每个已发现的服务匹配正确的仓库和工作区。",
    "Mapping discovered services to repositories and workspaces": "正在把已发现的服务映射到仓库和工作区",
    "Use the Simulator to manage mock servers and simulations. Get started by creating your first local mock.": "用模拟器管理模拟服务器和仿真。先创建你的第一个本地模拟吧。",
    "Search for any collection, preview the API context your agent will receive, and copy or download it instantly — no setup required.": "搜索任意集合，预览你的代理将收到的 API 上下文，随后即可立即复制或下载 —— 无需任何配置。",
    "With Insights, you get request volume, P95 latency, error rate, endpoint coverage, runtime metrics, and upstream and downstream dependencies.": "通过 Insights，你可以获得请求量、P95 延迟、错误率、端点覆盖率、运行时指标以及上下游依赖。",
    "No pull requests with CI activity were found in the last 7 days. Pull requests will appear here when Postman CLI runs are triggered from a PR context.": "最近 7 天没有发现带 CI 活动的拉取请求。当 Postman CLI 运行由 PR 触发时，拉取请求会显示在这里。",
    "Each service group is shown as one row: what was discovered on the left, where it will land in Postman on the right. Scroll to review every group in one pass.": "每个服务分组显示为一行：左侧是发现的内容，右侧是它将落到 Postman 的位置。滚动即可一次性检查所有分组。",
    "Insights powers API Catalog dashboards with service telemetry. Without it, integrated services can appear with empty dashboards: no live metrics, no health data, and no dependency graph.": "Insights 为 API 目录仪表盘提供服务遥测数据。没有它，已接入的服务可能显示为空仪表盘：没有实时指标、没有健康数据，也没有依赖关系图。",
    "Use the Postman API to push discovered services directly into your API Catalog. No cloud credentials or connectors needed - just an API key and a POST request.": "用 Postman API 把已发现的服务直接推送到 API 目录。不需要云凭据或连接器 —— 只要一个 API 密钥和一个 POST 请求。",
    "Anyone with the Collection Access Key can access the collection in JSON format, even those outside your team. Learn more about": "任何持有集合访问密钥的人都能以 JSON 格式访问该集合，包括团队之外的人。了解更多：",
    "When a developer forks your collection, it copies into their private workspace so they can add credentials, edit requests, and save progress—an early sign of deeper engagement and future API usage. Users who fork collections will generally have more usage and will be more engaged long-term than users who make API calls directly from your public workspace, where their work cannot be saved.": "开发者复刻你的集合时，集合会被复制到他们的私有工作区，从而可以填写凭据、修改请求并保存进度 —— 这是更深度参与和后续 API 使用的早期信号。相比直接在你的公开工作区调用 API（那里的改动无法保存），复刻集合的用户通常用量更大、长期参与度更高。",
    /* === batch-translated (auto-merged) === */
