    "Couldn't calculate the collection's size. It can't be restored if happens to be greater than 30 MB.": "无法计算该集合的大小。如果超过 30 MB，将无法恢复。",
    "Couldn’t calculate the collection’s size. It can’t be restored if happens to be greater than 30 MB.": "无法计算该集合的大小。如果超过 30 MB，将无法恢复。",
