    "Please try again using different keywords, filters and don’t forget to check for typos.": "请换用其他关键词或筛选条件重试，并注意检查是否有拼写错误。",
    "Please try again using different keywords, filters and don't forget to check for typos.": "请换用其他关键词或筛选条件重试，并注意检查是否有拼写错误。",
    "Here are some quick ways to get started with API development, design, testing, and more.": "以下是快速上手 API 开发、设计、测试等工作的一些方式。",
    "Hit enter/refresh. The search modal will open directly to that workspace. From there you can navigate collections and choose requests.": "按回车或刷新，搜索弹窗会直接打开该工作区。你可以从那里浏览集合并选择请求。",
    "The credentials are missing or expired. I can check the auth token, API key, or OAuth setup and get it authorized.": "凭据缺失或已过期。我可以检查认证令牌、API 密钥或 OAuth 配置并完成授权。",
    "The script failed while handling the response. I can read the error and fix the code.": "脚本在处理响应时失败。我可以查看错误并修复代码。",
    "The run finished with errors. I can use the run results to work out and apply the fix.": "运行结束但存在错误。我可以根据运行结果分析并应用修复。",
    "A script threw during the run. I can read the failing scripts and fix the code so the run completes.": "运行过程中脚本抛出了异常。我可以查看失败的脚本并修复代码，让运行顺利完成。",
    "You are sending requests faster than the API allows. I can add backoff and honor the Retry-After header.": "你发送请求的速度超过了 API 允许的上限。我可以添加退避重试并遵循 Retry-After 响应头。",
    "The certificate could not be verified. I can adjust SSL verification, the trust store, or the server certificate.": "证书无法验证。我可以调整 SSL 验证、信任库或服务器证书。",
    "The browser blocked the response. I can switch you to the desktop agent to bypass it, or help allow the origin on the server.": "浏览器拦截了该响应。我可以帮你切换到桌面代理来绕过限制，或协助在服务器端允许该来源。",
    "I'll search for the Notion API on Postman and generate TypeScript clients for search, pages, blocks, and databases. Then I'll wire them together into a command line app that can explore and map your workspace.": "我会在 Postman 上搜索 Notion API，并为 search、pages、blocks 和 databases 生成 TypeScript 客户端，然后把它们组装成一个可以浏览和梳理你工作区的命令行应用。",
    "I’ll search for the Notion API on Postman and generate TypeScript clients for search, pages, blocks, and databases. Then I’ll wire them together into a command line app that can explore and map your workspace.": "我会在 Postman 上搜索 Notion API，并为 search、pages、blocks 和 databases 生成 TypeScript 客户端，然后把它们组装成一个可以浏览和梳理你工作区的命令行应用。",
    "Create a command line application in TypeScript that builds a map of my Notion workspace using the Notion API.": "用 TypeScript 创建一个命令行应用，通过 Notion API 梳理我的 Notion 工作区结构。",
