    /* === batch-translated (auto-merged) === */
    "When the run is complete, the local variables are no longer available.": "运行完成后，本地变量将不再可用。",
    "Update your local value as you'd like, without sharing it with your teammates.": "你可以随意更新本地值，而无需与团队成员共享。",
    "Your teammates can continue to update their local value without sharing it.": "你的团队成员可以继续更新各自的本地值而无需共享。",
    "Each variable name represents its key, so referencing the variable name enables you to access its value.": "每个变量名代表它的键，因此引用变量名即可访问其值。",
    "Collection variables don't change based on the selected environment.": "集合变量不会因所选环境而改变。",
    "The value is only stored on your local machine and isn't shared with your team.": "该值仅存储在你的本地机器上，不会与团队共享。",
    "You can use variables to pass data between requests and tests.": "你可以使用变量在请求和测试之间传递数据。",
    "The value is stored on the Postman cloud and shared with anyone who has access to the element.": "该值存储在 Postman 云端，并与所有有权访问该元素的人共享。",
    "The shared value is updated based on your local value, sharing it with your teammates.": "共享值会根据你的本地值更新，并共享给你的团队成员。",
    "They can also reset their local value back to the shared value at any time.": "他们也可以随时将本地值重置回共享值。",
    "The local value is used when sending requests, and it isn't synced to the Postman cloud.": "发送请求时使用的是本地值，它不会同步到 Postman 云端。",
    "The value you enter for this variable is stored locally and is only available in the request it's set in.": "你为此变量输入的值存储在本地，仅在设置它的那个请求中可用。",
    "Local variables are scoped to a single request or collection run, and are no longer available when the run is complete.": "本地变量的作用域限于单次请求或集合运行，运行完成后即不再可用。",
    "For example, a global variable can be accessed in any collection, request, or script.": "例如，全局变量可以在任何集合、请求或脚本中访问。",
    "The variable isn't associated with a scope (highlighted by color) in the variable selector.": "该变量在变量选择器中未关联任何作用域（以颜色高亮显示）。",
    "This will permanently delete all your existing vaults secrets from all your devices. A fresh new vault will be created with a new vault key.": "此操作将从你的所有设备中永久删除所有现有的保险库密钥。系统会用新的保险库密钥创建一个全新的保险库。",
    "This will permanently delete all pm.state keys and can’t be undone.": "这将永久删除所有 pm.state 键，且此操作无法撤销。",
    "This will permanently delete all pm.state keys and can't be undone.": "这将永久删除所有 pm.state 键，且此操作无法撤销。",
    "This will permanently delete all logs and pm.state keys and can’t be undone.": "这将永久删除所有日志和 pm.state 键，且此操作无法撤销。",
    "This will permanently delete all logs and pm.state keys and can't be undone.": "这将永久删除所有日志和 pm.state 键，且此操作无法撤销。",
    "A variable can be empty for the following reasons:": "变量为空可能有以下原因：",
    "Choose one of the following:": "请选择以下选项之一：",
    "Define a collection variable.": "定义一个集合变量。",
    "Define a global variable.": "定义一个全局变量。",
    "Define a local variable.": "定义一个局部变量。",
    "If you want to access a variable from within a request body, wrap its reference in double-quotes:": "如果你想在请求正文中访问某个变量，请用双引号包裹它的引用：",
    "In order from broadest to narrowest, these scopes are:": "按从最宽到最窄的顺序，这些作用域为：",
    "No description added yet.": "尚未添加描述。",
    "No diagnostic issues found.": "未发现诊断问题。",
    "Postman provides dynamic variables you can use in your requests. Examples of dynamic variables include:": "Postman 提供可在请求中使用的动态变量。动态变量示例包括：",
    "Postman sends the value stored for the \"cust_id\" variable when the request runs. If \"cust_id\" has a \"3\" value, the request is sent to the following URL with the query parameter:": "请求运行时，Postman 会发送 \"cust_id\" 变量存储的值。如果 \"cust_id\" 的值为 \"3\"，请求将带上该查询参数发送到以下 URL：",
