    "Vault key invalid. Try again.": "保险库密钥无效。请重试。",
    "When you run a request, Postman resolves the variable and replaces it with your value. For example, you could have a request URL referencing a variable:": "当你运行请求时，Postman 会解析该变量并用你的值替换它。例如，你可以有一个引用变量的请求 URL：",
