    "The environment that has the variable isn’t active.": "拥有该变量的环境未处于激活状态。",
    "The environment you want to add a variable to must be active in the environment selector. If an environment isn’t active, you can add a variable to an environment using one of the following options in the dropdown list:": "你要添加变量的环境必须在环境选择器中处于激活状态。如果某个环境未激活，你可以使用下拉列表中的以下选项之一将变量添加到该环境：",
