    "HTTP request blocks in Flows, calling APIs from Flows, block outputs": "Flows 中的 HTTP 请求块、从 Flows 调用 API、块输出",
    "This collection has no requests to visualize. Add some requests first.": "此集合没有可可视化的请求。请先添加一些请求。",
    "Mock server stub setup and configuration, URL format, request matching": "模拟服务器桩的设置与配置、URL 格式、请求匹配",
    "We couldn’t fetch your request due to some unforseen circumstances. Try again.": "由于一些意外情况，我们无法获取你的请求。请重试。",
    "Upgrade to get instant access to unlimited runs, additional AI credits, and more!": "升级即可立即获得无限运行次数、额外 AI 额度等更多权益！",
    "We will let you know when the agent is ready to use so you can resend your request.": "代理准备就绪后我们会通知你，届时你可以重新发送请求。",
    "Runs before each HTTP request is sent. Generally used to configure requests dynamically.": "在每个 HTTP 请求发送前运行。通常用于动态配置请求。",
    "Runs before each gRPC request is sent. Generally used to configure requests dynamically.": "在每个 gRPC 请求发送前运行。通常用于动态配置请求。",
    "Collections and environments of this API will move with this API to the destination workspace.": "此 API 的集合和环境将随此 API 一起移动到目标工作区。",
    "Build agents using predefined Flows. For extensible tool support, try AI Agent with MCP Servers.": "使用预定义的 Flows 构建代理。如需可扩展的工具支持，请尝试搭配 MCP 服务器的 AI 代理。",
    "List all tools available in a namespace, including names, descriptions, and input/output schemas.": "列出命名空间中所有可用工具，包括名称、描述和输入/输出架构。",
    "Are you sure you want to publish Fern Docs for this collection? It can be unpublished at any time.": "确定要为此集合发布 Fern Docs 吗？随时可以取消发布。",
    "This request could not be loaded since you’re offline. Check your internet connection and try again.": "由于你处于离线状态，无法加载此请求。请检查网络连接后重试。",
    "Are you sure you want to unpublish Fern Docs for this collection? It can be republished at any time.": "确定要取消发布此集合的 Fern Docs 吗？随时可以重新发布。",
    "When true, the published mock requires an x-api-key header for incoming requests. Defaults to false.": "为 true 时，已发布的模拟服务器要求传入请求带有 x-api-key 请求头。默认为 false。",
    "Monitors, scheduled collection runs, mock servers and integrations using this environment may no longer work.": "使用此环境的监视器、计划集合运行、模拟服务器和集成可能不再正常工作。",
    "Upgrade to get instant access to unlimited runs, additional AI credits, and the ability to deploy Actions to the cloud.": "升级即可立即获得无限运行次数、额外 AI 额度，以及将动作部署到云端的能力。",
    "Using the collection run results, analyze the actual API responses and generate bulk tests for all requests in the collection.": "利用集合运行结果，分析实际的 API 响应，并为集合中的所有请求批量生成测试。",
    "Fix the errors from this collection run. Update the failing requests, scripts, or configuration so the run completes successfully.": "修复此次集合运行中的错误。更新失败的请求、脚本或配置，使运行成功完成。",
    "Postman uses the browser's default settings for sending requests. Switch to the desktop agent to customize your collection further.": "Postman 使用浏览器的默认设置发送请求。切换到桌面代理可进一步自定义你的集合。",
    "Monitors of this collection will pause and stay in the current workspace. Scheduled runs will move as a part of the collection and continue to run.": "此集合的监视器将暂停并保留在当前工作区。计划运行将随集合一起移动并继续运行。",
    "Select a collection to run": "选择要运行的集合",
    "Performance testing is currently not available for collections inside an API. We are working on making this available soon!": "目前不支持对 API 内部的集合进行性能测试。我们正在努力尽快推出此功能！",
    "There are deleted requests in the custom run order which may cause errors in your runs. You can review the run order and remove these deleted requests.": "自定义运行顺序中存在已删除的请求，可能导致运行出错。你可以查看运行顺序并移除这些已删除的请求。",
    /* === batch-translated (auto-merged) === */
    "Send HTTP requests without any of the limitations imposed by the browser’s cross-origin resource sharing policies.": "发送 HTTP 请求，不受浏览器跨域资源共享策略的任何限制。",
    "Some files used in this request couldn’t be downloaded from Postman as you have reached the limit for data file retrievals. Learn more about": "此请求使用的部分文件无法从 Postman 下载，因为你已达到数据文件检索次数上限。了解更多：",
    "Sending a request through a browser comes with a lot of limitations. To fully use all that Postman has to offer, download and use the Postman Desktop Agent to send your requests. With it, you can:": "通过浏览器发送请求存在诸多限制。要充分使用 Postman 的全部功能，请下载并使用 Postman 桌面代理来发送请求。有了它，你可以：",
    "Create a new untitled HTTP request tab by passing in a curl command as a string. This will automatically open a new tab with the request configured in it. Use this to view the response of any URL or API.": "通过传入 curl 命令字符串创建一个新的未命名 HTTP 请求标签页。这会自动打开一个已配置好该请求的新标签页。用它查看任意 URL 或 API 的响应。",
    "Create or open a HTTP request in a new tab by passing in a curl command as a string. This will automatically open a new tab with the request configured in it. Use this to view the response of any URL or API.": "通过传入 curl 命令字符串在新标签页中创建或打开一个 HTTP 请求。这会自动打开一个已配置好该请求的新标签页。用它查看任意 URL 或 API 的响应。",
    "List updates for a workspace. If no workspace ID is provided, lists updates for the current workspace. Updates are announcements, project changes, feature releases, bug fixes, or announcements added by developers.": "列出工作区的更新。若未提供工作区 ID，则列出当前工作区的更新。更新指开发者添加的公告、项目变更、功能发布或缺陷修复。",
    "Creates Postman mock server for a collection. A mock server is used to simulate an API or test an API without having to configure a real API server or without a real backend. Mock server can be set up for any HTTP collection. Postman returns a real-world response using data from the collection, when a request is sent to the mock server.": "为集合创建 Postman 模拟服务器。模拟服务器用于模拟 API，或在无需配置真实 API 服务器、无需真实后端的情况下测试 API。可为任意 HTTP 集合设置模拟服务器。当请求发送到模拟服务器时，Postman 会使用集合中的数据返回真实的响应。",
    "The description of a folder usually contains an overview of what this section of the API does. Don't include information that is relevant to the whole API, only specific data types that are used in the endpoints in this particular folder and ways of using these endpoints that differentiate it from the other requests in the API.": "文件夹的描述通常概述这部分 API 的功能。不要包含与整个 API 相关的信息，只写这个文件夹中端点所用的特定数据类型，以及这些端点区别于 API 中其他请求的用法。",
