    "Gets or sets a value that defines where snap-points will be located along the y-axis.": "获取或设置定义吸附点沿 y 轴位置的值。",
    "The box-flex-group CSS property assigns the flexbox's child elements to a flex group.": "box-flex-group 属性将弹性框的子元素分配到某个弹性组。",
    "Gets or sets a value that specifies the maximum value for the scrollTop property.": "获取或设置指定 scrollTop 属性最大值的值。",
