    "Gets or sets a value that specifies the maximum value for the scrollLeft property.": "获取或设置指定 scrollLeft 属性最大值的值。",
    "Gets or sets a value that specifies the minimum value for the scrollLeft property.": "获取或设置指定 scrollLeft 属性最小值的值。",
    "No additional spacing is applied. Computes to zero.": "不应用额外间距，计算值为零。",
