    "Specifies the width of the stroke on the current object.": "指定当前对象描边的宽度。",
    "Inline flow content can flow on all sides of the exclusion.": "行内流内容可以环绕排除区域的所有边。",
    "Specifies the handling of overflow in the vertical direction.": "指定垂直方向溢出内容的处理方式。",
    "Used to construct the default contents of a list item's marker": "用于构建列表项标记的默认内容",
    "Specifies the handling of overflow in the horizontal direction.": "指定水平方向溢出内容的处理方式。",
    "Text can overflow for example when it is prevented from wrapping.": "在禁止换行等情况下，文本可以溢出。",
    "Extends the width of the space character while surrounded by ideographs.": "当空格字符被表意文字包围时，扩展其宽度。",
