    "Specifies whether or not an element is resizable by the user, and if so, along which axis/axes.": "指定元素是否可由用户调整大小，以及可沿哪些轴调整。",
    "The ruby text can overhang text adjacent to the base on either side. This is the initial value.": "ruby 注音文本可以向基准文字两侧的相邻文本悬出。这是初始值。",
