    "Determines the width of the tab character (U+0009), in space characters (U+0020), when rendered.": "确定制表符（U+0009）渲染时的宽度，以空格字符（U+0020）为单位。",
    "Counters are denoted by identifiers (see the 'counter-increment' and 'counter-reset' properties).": "计数器由标识符表示（参见 'counter-increment' 和 'counter-reset' 属性）。",
