    "Shorthand property for the -ms-content-zoom-snap-type and -ms-content-zoom-snap-points properties.": "-ms-content-zoom-snap-type 和 -ms-content-zoom-snap-points 属性的简写属性。",
    "Sets or retrieves the size of the character grid used for rendering the text content of an element.": "设置或获取用于渲染元素文本内容的字符网格大小。",
