    "Represents a styleable child pseudo-element immediately before the originating element's actual content.": "表示紧位于起源元素实际内容之前、可设样式的子伪元素。",
    "Indicates the element does not display scrollbars or panning indicators, even when its content overflows.": "指示元素即使内容溢出也不显示滚动条或平移指示器。",
    "Force one or two page breaks before the generated box so that the next page is formatted as a right page.": "在生成盒之前强制一到两个分页，使下一页排版为右页。",
    "The -webkit-mask-repeat-y property specifies whether and how a mask image is repeated (tiled) vertically.": "-webkit-mask-repeat-y 属性指定遮罩图像是否以及如何在垂直方向重复（平铺）。",
    "The auto-placement algorithm places items by filling each column in turn, adding new columns as necessary.": "自动放置算法依次填满每一列来放置项目，必要时新增列。",
