    "Pause a webhook. If webhookId is omitted, pauses the currently active webhook tab.": "暂停 Webhook。如果省略 webhookId，则暂停当前活动的 Webhook 标签页。",
    "Tell us a little bit more about your organization and we'll get in touch with you.": "告诉我们更多关于你所在组织的信息，我们会与你联系。",
    "Fastest and most compact model in the Claude family for near-instant responsiveness": "Claude 系列中最快、最紧凑的模型，可实现近乎即时的响应",
    "Runs after each HTTP response. Generally used to write tests and visualize responses.": "在每个 HTTP 响应后运行。通常用于编写测试和可视化响应。",
    "Add-on products extend the capabilities of Postman and help you to get more out of it.": "附加组件产品可扩展 Postman 的功能，帮助你更充分地使用它。",
    "Start line for 'lines' mode (1-based, inclusive). Must be within the file. Example: 100": "'lines' 模式的起始行（从 1 开始，含）。必须在文件范围内。示例：100",
    "Next generation features, speed, and multimodal generation for a diverse variety of tasks": "新一代功能、速度和多模态生成，适用于各种任务",
    "Store performance metrics in Postman Cloud for historical comparison and error debugging.": "将性能指标存储在 Postman Cloud 中，用于历史对比和错误调试。",
    "Array of values to select in the dropdown. This can be a single value or multiple values.": "下拉框中要选择的值数组。可以是单个值或多个值。",
    "When true, also fetch the handler source code and its parsed endpoints. Defaults to false.": "为 true 时，同时获取处理程序源代码及其解析出的端点。默认为 false。",
    "We're happy to answer questions and get you acquainted with the Postman features and trial.": "我们很乐意回答问题，帮你熟悉 Postman 的功能和试用。",
    "Most powerful model in the Claude family with the highest level of intelligence and capability": "Claude 系列中最强大的模型，拥有最高水平的智能与能力",
    "Script error details are not saved for past runs. You can run again to get the latest results.": "过去运行的脚本错误详情不会保存。你可以重新运行以获取最新结果。",
    "Open a webhook tab by webhook ID. Use listWebhooks first when you need to find the webhook ID.": "通过 Webhook ID 打开 Webhook 标签页。需要查找 Webhook ID 时请先使用 listWebhooks。",
    "Ask an approver from your organization to add billing information and make the payment for you.": "请你所在组织的审批人添加账单信息并为你付款。",
    "The VAT ID starts with two-letter country code (e.g. DE for Germany) followed immediately by numbers.": "VAT ID 以两位字母的国家代码开头（e.g. DE 表示德国），后面紧跟数字。",
    "Get context graph schema including node labels, relationship types, and allowed source-target mappings.": "获取上下文图架构，包括节点标签、关系类型和允许的源-目标映射。",
    "Save performance metrics to Postman Cloud for cross-run comparison, error debugging, and historical analysis": "将性能指标保存到 Postman Cloud，用于跨运行对比、错误调试和历史分析",
    "End line for 'lines' mode (1-based, inclusive). A value past end-of-file is clamped automatically. Example: 150": "'lines' 模式的结束行（从 1 开始，含）。超出文件末尾的值会自动截断。示例：150",
    "Communication with the interceptor is always encrypted. Add a custom encryption key for an additional layer of security.": "与 Interceptor 的通信始终加密。添加自定义加密密钥可增加一层额外的安全保护。",
