    "Only users who have authorized Slack can see channels connected to this workspace.": "只有已授权 Slack 的用户才能看到连接到此工作区的频道。",
    "View basic information about direct messages that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的私信的基本信息",
    "The selected users don’t have any personal workspaces. Adjust your filter settings.": "所选用户没有任何个人工作区。请调整筛选设置。",
    "View basic information about private channels that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的私有频道的基本信息",
    "A personal workspace lets you work on APIs independently. No one else can access it.": "个人工作区让你可以独立处理 API。其他人无法访问。",
    "Display the requested data without showing the cURL progress meter or error messages": "显示请求的数据，不显示 cURL 进度条或错误消息",
    "Your app does not support the latest version of the connected repository integration.": "你的应用不支持已连接仓库集成的最新版本。",
    "Google's best model in terms of price-performance, offering well-rounded capabilities": "Google 性价比最高的模型，能力全面",
    "View files shared in channels and conversations that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的频道和对话中共享的文件",
    "Share important announcements and communicate API changes directly from your workspace.": "直接从你的工作区分享重要公告并传达 API 变更。",
    "Current definition contains all the changes made to the API that are not yet published.": "当前定义包含对 API 所做的所有尚未发布的更改。",
    "Fast, budget-friendly Gemini 2.5 multimodal model for lightweight and high-volume tasks": "面向轻量和大批量任务的快速、经济的 Gemini 2.5 多模态模型",
    "View pinned content in channels and conversations that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的频道和对话中的置顶内容",
    "A URI that indicates the resource/target service where the token is intended to be used.": "指示令牌预期使用的资源/目标服务的 URI。",
    "View messages and other content in public channels that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的公共频道中的消息及其他内容",
    "View messages and other content in direct messages that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的私信中的消息及其他内容",
    "View basic information about group direct messages that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的群组私信的基本信息",
    "A URI that indicates the target audience/services where the token is intended to be used.": "指示令牌预期使用的目标受众/服务的 URI。",
    "View messages and other content in private channels that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的私有频道中的消息及其他内容",
    "To see your team’s connected channels or set up new Slack notifications, sign in to a team.": "要查看团队已连接的频道或设置新的 Slack 通知，请登录到团队。",
    "Anthropic's most capable generally available model for complex reasoning and agentic coding": "Anthropic 能力最强的正式可用模型，适用于复杂推理和代理编码",
    "Help your team maintain a shared source of truth, to build APIs and solve problems together.": "帮助你的团队维护共享的单一事实来源，一起构建 API、解决问题。",
    "This header has been automatically added. You can choose to remove it, or override its value.": "此请求头已自动添加。你可以选择移除它或覆盖其值。",
    "View messages and other content in group direct messages that your slack app has been added to": "查看你的 Slack 应用已加入的群组私信中的消息及其他内容",
    "Google's best price-performance model for low-latency, high-volume tasks that require reasoning": "Google 性价比最高的模型，适用于需要推理的低延迟、大批量任务",
    "Show detailed execution information including retry attempts, redirects, and timing breakdowns.": "显示详细的执行信息，包括重试、重定向和耗时分解。",
    "Stable Gemini 3.5 model optimized for sustained frontier performance on agentic and coding tasks": "稳定的 Gemini 3.5 模型，针对代理和编码任务的持续前沿性能优化",
    "Pull Request is being merged in the background. Please check again later to view merged changes.": "拉取请求正在后台合并。请稍后再查看合并的更改。",
    "Switch to a different workspace. This will change the list of active collections and environments.": "切换到其他工作区。这将更改当前的集合和环境列表。",
    "Delete a view from a dataset. Removes it from both the daemon engine and the YAML definition file.": "从数据集中删除视图。会同时从守护进程引擎和 YAML 定义文件中移除。",
    "Stable low-latency, cost-effective Gemini 3.1 multimodal model for high-frequency lightweight tasks": "稳定、低延迟、高性价比的 Gemini 3.1 多模态模型，适用于高频轻量任务",
    "A public workspace is visible to everyone on the Public API Network to explore and start collaborating.": "公开工作区对公共 API 网络上的所有人可见，可供探索和协作。",
    "Google's state-of-the-art thinking model for complex reasoning, coding, STEM, and long-context analysis": "Google 最先进的思考模型，适用于复杂推理、编码、STEM 和长上下文分析",
    "This removes all auth types configured in this folder and resets to auth type inherited from the parent.": "这将移除此文件夹中配置的所有身份验证类型，并重置为从父级继承的身份验证类型。",
    "First Flash-Lite model in the Gemini 3 series, delivering frontier-class performance at a fraction of the cost": "Gemini 3 系列中首个 Flash-Lite 模型，以极低成本提供前沿级性能",
    "Whether to automatically discover the workspace containing the service if workspaceId is not provided (default: false)": "如果未提供 workspaceId，是否自动发现包含该服务的工作区（默认：false）",
