    "This header was automatically added": "此请求头是自动添加的",
    "The Host request-header field specifies the Internet host and port number of the resource being requested, as obtained from the original URI.": "Host 请求头字段指定原始 URI 中资源的 Internet 主机和端口号。",
    "The Connection header field determines how long to maintain a connection between the client and the server after a response is sent.": "Connection 请求头字段用于决定在发送响应后，客户端和服务器之间的连接保持多久。",
    "The Connection general-header field allows the sender to specify options that are desired for that particular connection.": "Connection 通用请求头字段允许发送方指定该连接所需的选项。",
    "The Upgrade header is used by the client to request the server to switch to a different protocol.": "Upgrade 请求头用于客户端请求服务器切换到其他协议。",
    "The WebSocket handshake uses the HTTP Upgrade header to change from the HTTP protocol to the WebSocket protocol.": "WebSocket 握手使用 HTTP Upgrade 请求头，将 HTTP 协议切换为 WebSocket 协议。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Key header field contains a Base64-encoded value that is used by the server to prove that it received a valid WebSocket opening handshake.": "Sec-WebSocket-Key 请求头字段包含一个 Base64 编码值，服务器会用它来证明已收到有效的 WebSocket 开启握手。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Key header field is used in the WebSocket opening handshake. It is sent from the client to the server to provide part of the information used by the server to prove that it received a valid WebSocket opening handshake. This helps ensure that the server does not accept connections from non-WebSocket clients (e.g., HTTP clients) that are being abused to send data to unsuspecting WebSocket servers.": "Sec-WebSocket-Key 请求头字段用于 WebSocket 开启握手。它由客户端发送给服务器，提供服务器用于证明已收到有效 WebSocket 开启握手的部分信息。这有助于确保服务器不会接受被滥用来向 WebSocket 服务器发送数据的非 WebSocket 客户端（例如 HTTP 客户端）连接。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Version header field is used in the WebSocket opening handshake. It is sent from the client to the server to indicate the protocol version of the connection. This enables servers to correctly interpret the opening handshake and subsequent data being sent from the data, and close the connection if the server cannot interpret that data in a safe manner.": "Sec-WebSocket-Version 请求头字段用于 WebSocket 开启握手。它由客户端发送给服务器，用于指示连接的协议版本。这使服务器能够正确解释开启握手以及随后发送的数据；如果服务器无法以安全方式解释这些数据，则可以关闭连接。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Version header field is used in the WebSocket opening handshake. It is sent from the client to the server to indicate the protocol version of the connection. This enables servers to correctly interpret the opening handshake and subsequent data being sent from the client, and close the connection if the server cannot interpret that data in a safe manner.": "Sec-WebSocket-Version 请求头字段用于 WebSocket 开启握手。它由客户端发送给服务器，用于指示连接的协议版本。这使服务器能够正确解释开启握手以及随后从客户端发送的数据；如果服务器无法以安全方式解释这些数据，则可以关闭连接。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Extensions header field is used in the WebSocket opening handshake to negotiate extensions with the server.": "Sec-WebSocket-Extensions 请求头字段用于在 WebSocket 开启握手期间与服务器协商扩展。",
    "The Sec-WebSocket-Extensions header field is used in the WebSocket opening handshake. It is initially sent from the client to the server, and then subsequently sent from the server to the client, to agree on a set of protocol-level extensions to use for the duration of the connection.": "Sec-WebSocket-Extensions 请求头字段用于 WebSocket 开启握手。它最初由客户端发送给服务器，随后由服务器发送给客户端，用于协商连接期间要使用的一组协议级扩展。",
    "The Host 请求-header field specifies the Internet host and port number of the resource being 请求ed, as obtained from the original URI.": "Host 请求头字段指定原始 URI 中资源的 Internet 主机和端口号。",
